    "intent": "The AWS service inventory is complete. Your task is to design the target GCP architecture. Read the `aws_service_inventory.json` from the mission artifacts directory. For each AWS service, design a corresponding Google Cloud Run service configuration. Your design must map AWS resources to their GCP equivalents. Specifically: 1. Map AWS IAM roles to GCP IAM Service Accounts with appropriate roles/permissions. 2. Define Cloud Run resource allocations (CPU, memory) based on the AWS specs. 3. Design the network configuration using Serverless VPC Access connectors to replicate VPC and security group functionality. 4. Propose migration strategies for all dependent data stores (RDS, DynamoDB, S3) to their GCP counterparts (Cloud SQL, Firestore/Bigtable, Cloud Storage). Create a detailed design document named `gcp_target_architecture.md` and save it to the mission artifacts directory."
  }
